  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Grape salad is a sweet and creamy dish made with fresh grapes, cream cheese, and Greek yogurt for a light yet indulgent flavor. Drizzled with honey and topped with crunchy pecans or almonds, it’s a refreshing salad that’s perfect for potlucks, barbecues, or brunch. Quick to prepare and always a crowd favorite, grape salad is a simple recipe that adds color and sweetness to any table.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-grape-salad\">Why You’ll Love This Grape Salad</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-grape-salad\">How to Make Grape Salad</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-grape-salad\">Pro Tips for Making Grape Salad</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-grape-salad\">How to Serve this Grape Salad</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-grape-salad\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This Grape Salad</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>It&#8217;s a burst of freshness in every bite!</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Perfect balance of sweet and creamy flavors.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Quick and easy to prepare for any occasion.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Loaded with vitamins and antioxidants.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>A crowd-pleaser that everyone will adore!</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-3380\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"3380\" data-servings=\"8\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe wprm-recipe-template-meadow\"><div class=\"wprm-layout-container wprm-padding-40 meadow-header\">\n  <div class=\"wprm-layout-column-container wprm-column-gap-20 wprm-column-rows-recipe-600 wprm-column-rows-reverse w